                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2920659,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "We're hoping to change the location of the toilets and bring them nearer to the center of the park as they're a bit out of the way at present near the adventure playground in the corner of your map. The formal gardens have been replanted and should be at their best in a month or two. They used to be behind the old museum, but we've now used the space near the South gate between the park boundary and the path that goes past the lake towards the old museum. We have a new outdoor gym for adults and children, which is already proving very popular. It's by the glass houses just to the right of the path from the South gate.",
